Reads the slot's sync flag in wait_released, after the slot is queued,
instead of the copy submit takes before queuing it. The batch's executor
writes the slot's fields (execute_slots sets slot.sync for every slot it
runs), so the waiting owner's read races with that write: the race the
TSan soak and every thread-sanitizer CI leg reported on #224 before the
fix. Expected: caught.
Guarded-by: "WriteGroup slots may be destroyed as soon as submit returns"
Sanitizer: thread
